The `.data` section has VMA (runtime address) in RAM (0x34000400+) and LMA (load address) in FLASH_APP (0x70080000+). The `_eronly` symbol at line 82 marks the end of the read-only sections in flash, which is the LMA of `.data`.


The startup code copies initialized data from the load address in flash to its runtime location in RAM, using `_eronly` as the source and `_sdata`/`_edata` as the destination boundaries.

